    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200602/2022006020050"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006020060,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "で、でも、これって確か３人くらいで\r\nチームを組むんじゃなかったですか？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200602/2022006020060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006020070,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "色々な高校の、クイズ部の子とかが……",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200602/2022006020070"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、番組には一般人の現役高校生たちも\r\n出演するよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006020080,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "透ちゃんとか円香ちゃんとか\r\n雛菜ちゃんと出る……ってこと、ですかね……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200602/2022006020080"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006020090,
    "speaker": "小糸",
    "text": "チームとして……？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "koito",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/202200602/2022006020090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああ、いや！\r\n違うよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは『高校生チーム』の方だろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2022006020100,
